  "title": "Luxuriant Spicy Ethiopian Collard Greens Gomen",
  "description": "A spicy and energizing Ethiopian dish featuring treacle and mushimono-steam, perfect for a weeknight dinner. This egg-free-friendly recipe is a twist on traditional gomen.",
